  description: '"Gladiator Beast Spartacus" + 1 "Gladiator Beast" monster

    This
    card can only be Special Summoned from your Extra Deck, by returning the above
    cards you control to the Deck. (You do not use "Polymerization".) When this card
    destroys a monster by battle and sends it to the Graveyard, inflict damage to
    your opponent equal to the DEF of the destroyed monster. At the end of the Battle
    Phase, if this card attacked or was attacked, you can return it to the Extra
    Deck to Special Summon 2 "Gladiator Beast" monsters from your Deck, except "Gladiator
    Beast Spartacus".'
